This GUML code defines a simple BMI calculator page. The user can input their height and weight, and the page will calculate and display their BMI and category. The `bmi` object is used to store the calculated BMI and category, and the `optimistic` strategy is used to update the `bmi` object when the user submits the form. The `reset` button is used to reset the height and weight fields to zero and the BMI to zero.
